Package: lxc-hotplug-host
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.7)
Maintainer: LXC Hotplug Team <support@example.com>
Description: LXC USB Hotplug Host Agent for Proxmox VE
 Daemon running on Proxmox VE host that monitors USB events via kernel netlink
 and notifies privileged LXC containers with dynamic cgroup v2 permissions.
